  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "There was a table set out under a tree in front of the house, and the March Hare and the Hatter were having tea at it: a Dormouse was sitting between them, fast asleep, and the other two were using it as a cushion, resting their elbows on it, and talking over its head.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 14281,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“Very uncomfortable for the Dormouse,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 14731,
          "end": 16655,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "thought Alice;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 16905,
          "end": 17612,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“only, as it’s asleep, I suppose it doesn’t mind.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 17862,
          "end": 20417,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The table was a large one, but the three were all crowded together at one corner of it:",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 21177,
          "end": 25291,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“No room!",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 25541,
          "end": 25977,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true
        },
        {
          "text": "No room!”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 26407,
          "end": 26958,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true
        },
        {
          "text": "they cried out when they saw Alice coming.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 27268,
          "end": 28817,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“There’s plenty of room!”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 29117,
          "end": 30284,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice indignantly, and she sat down in a large arm-chair at one end of the table.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 30594,
          "end": 35274,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Have some wine,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 36034,
          "end": 36831,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "the March Hare said in an encouraging tone.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 37081,
          "end": 38875,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Alice looked all round the table, but there was nothing on it but tea.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 39635,
          "end": 42842,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“I don’t see any wine,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 43292,
          "end": 44429,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "she remarked.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 44679,
          "end": 45235,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“There isn’t any,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 45535,
          "end": 46302,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the March Hare.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 46552,
          "end": 47489,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Then it wasn’t very civil of you to offer it,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 47729,
          "end": 49848,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice angrily.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 50098,
          "end": 51105,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“It wasn’t very civil of you to sit down without being invited,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 51625,
          "end": 54777,
          "voice": "M2",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "March Hare"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the March Hare.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 55027,
          "end": 55964,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“I didn’t know it was your table,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 56484,
          "end": 58003,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "said Alice;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 58253,
          "end": 58924,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“it’s laid for a great many more than three.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 59174,
          "end": 61183,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“Your hair wants cutting,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 61483,
          "end": 62550,
          "voice": "M3",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Hatter"
        },
        {
          "text": "said the Hatter.",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 62800,
          "end": 63512,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "He had been looking at Alice for some time with great curiosity, and this was his first speech.",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 63882,
          "end": 68718,
          "voice": "F2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "“You should learn not to make personal remarks,”",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 69478,
          "end": 71727,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        },
        {
          "text": "Alice said with some severity;",
          "gap": " ",
          "start": 71977,
          "end": 73325,
          "voice": "F2"
        },
        {
          "text": "“it’s very rude.”",
          "gap": "",
          "start": 73575,
          "end": 74527,
          "voice": "F5",
          "dialogue": true,
          "speaker": "Alice"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
